  mkfs.ext4, e2fsprogs/mke2fs.conf
      e2fsprogs: the programs GPL-2.0-only, lib/ext2fs and lib/e2p
      LGPL-2.0-only, lib/uuid BSD-3-Clause, lib/et and lib/ss MIT. Statically
      linked against libarchive (BSD-2-Clause) and what libarchive is built
      with, as its pkg-config names them: libacl (LGPL-2.1-or-later), expat
      (MIT), zstd (BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-only), lz4 (BSD-2-Clause), bzip2
